{"unit_id":"tag:04FS:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001>支集（support），对于<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>而言，是点（points）<MATH_0005>组成的集合（set），这些点满足<MATH_0006>，对位于<MATH_0008>之上的任意（某个）几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0007>如此。\n<STRUCT_0003>设<MATH_0009>为截面（section）。<TEXTITOPEN_0002>支集（support），对于<MATH_0010><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>而言，是闭子集（closed subset）<MATH_0011>，其中<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的最大开子集（open subset），使<MATH_0014>在其上的限制（restricts）为零（见引理<REF_0001>）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"open subset","target_term":"开子集"},{"source_term":"restricts","target_term":"限制"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"open subset","target_term":"开子集","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"restricts","target_term":"限制","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04FQ:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n一般而言，阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）的支集（support）并不闭（closed）。例如，设<MATH_0001>。设<MATH_0002>为点（point）<MATH_0003>的包含映射（inclusion）。后面会看到，<MATH_0004>为阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），其支集（support）恰为<MATH_0005>，见第<REF_0001>节。于是\n<MATH_0006>\n为阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），其支集（support）为<MATH_0007>。这是因为取茎（stalks）与余极限（colimits）交换（commutes），见引理<REF_0002>。这便给出了支集（support）不闭（closed）的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）的例子。下面给出层（sheaves）和截面（sections）的支集（supports）的一些基本事实。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含映射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"supports","target_term":"支集"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"support","target_term":"支集","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sections","target_ter